OL,3,ARoyal Family to visit Aberfan to mark
OL,4,A60 years since disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III, Queen Camilla and the
OL,7,FPrince of Wales will be among the
OL,8,Fvisitors to Aberfan on Wednesday to
OL,9,Fmark 60 years since a coal waste tip
OL,10,Fcollapsed on to a school in the mining
OL,11,Fvillage and killed 144 children and
OL,12,Fadults.
OL,14,FA prayer and moment of silence will be
OL,15,Fheld, and a male voice choir formed in
OL,16,Fthe aftermath of the disaster will
OL,17,Fsing.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
