OL,3,ARoyal Family to visit Aberfan to mark
OL,4,A60 years since disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe royals will also join survivors,
OL,7,Fbereaved parents and other members of
OL,8,Fthe community, who will share their
OL,9,Fpersonal reflections to mark the
OL,10,Fanniversary.
OL,12,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,13,Fadults were killed when the colliery
OL,14,Fspoil tip collapsed and engulfed
OL,15,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,16,Fhouses.
